[ti:Once In A Lifetime]
[ar:Wolfsheim]
[length:3:42]
[lang:english]
[langs:english]

[00:17.00]It's getting dark
[00:19.50]too soon
[00:21.80]A threatening silence
[00:24.50]surrounding me
[00:27.30]A wind
[00:29.60]comes up from the islands
[00:32.50]When distance fades to stormy grey
[00:36.10]Washed out from the deep of the ocean
[00:39.60]Here I will stand to face your wrath
[00:45.50]While all the others are praying
[00:47.50]Calm down my heart
[00:49.30]Don't beat so fast
[00:51.20]Don't be afraid
[00:52.70]Just once in a lifetime
[00:55.35]Calm down my heart
[00:57.05]Don't beat so fast
[00:59.30]Don't be afraid
[01:00.45]Just once in a lifetime
[01:04.45]No rain can wash away my tears
[01:07.00]No wind can soothe my pain
[01:11.00]You made me doubt, you made me fear
[01:14.80]But now I'm not the same
[01:18.25]You took my wife, my unborn son
[01:22.00]Torn into the deep of the ocean
[01:26.20]I don't pretend that I love you
[01:30.00]'Cause there is nothing left to lose
[01:50.40]And when silence comes back to me
[01:54.30]I find myself feeling lonely
[01:56.70]Standing here on the shores of destiny
[02:02.00]I find myself feeling lonely
[02:04.80]I had a life to give, many dreams to live
[02:08.50]Don't you know that you're
[02:10.30]losing so much this time
[02:13.10]Beyond the waves, I will be free
[02:18.20]While all the others are praying
[02:20.40]Calm down my heart
[02:22.20]Don't beat so fast
[02:24.10]Don't be afraid
[02:25.60]Just once in a lifetime
[02:28.25]Calm down my heart
[02:29.95]Don't beat so fast
[02:32.25]Don't be afraid
[02:33.40]Just once in a lifetime
[02:36.00]No rain can wash away my tears
[02:39.90]No wind can soothe my pain
[02:44.00]You made me doubt, you made me fear
[02:47.60]But now I'm not the same
[02:51.00]You took my wife, my unborn son
[02:55.00]Torn into the deep of the ocean
[02:59.50]I don't pretend that I love you
[03:03.00]'Cause there is nothing left to loose
[03:07.00]The love in you, it does not burn
[03:11.00]There is no lesson you can learn
[03:15.00]And there are sounds you cannot hear
[03:18.50]And there are feelings you can't feel
[03:22.50]Calm down my heart
[03:24.00]Don't beat so fast
[03:26.30]Don't be afraid
[03:27.50]Just once in a lifetime
[03:30.20]I don't pretend that I love you
[03:34.10]And this time I'm not scared of you
